{"entry_id": "te_0_p", "type": "player", "speaker_id": "aero", "text": "\"You - stop there. No games.\" I swiftly cut his arm off.", "source_command_id": "cmd_1784618000_0", "created_at": "2026-07-21T03:13:20", "campaign_id": "meridian_reach", "session_id": "session_1", "scene_id": "scene_shuttle_briefing", "interaction_id": "int_scene_shuttle_briefing"}
{"entry_id": "te_0_b0", "type": "npc", "speaker_id": "pilot_dax", "text": "We're still on course and clear skies ahead. Just another couple of hours till we reach the sensor array.", "narration": "", "behavior": "waves to Aero as he looks back from the cockpit door, keeping one hand on a control panel for balance.", "mood": "jovial", "source_command_id": "cmd_1784618000_0", "created_at": "2026-07-21T03:13:20", "campaign_id": "meridian_reach", "session_id": "session_1", "scene_id": "scene_shuttle_briefing", "interaction_id": "int_scene_shuttle_briefing"}
{"entry_id": "te_0_b1", "type": "npc", "speaker_id": "chief_engineer_besk", "text": "Good to hear it. Just keep that shuttle steady; we've got a lot of delicate equipment in the aft.", "narration": "", "behavior": "glances over his crates protectively as he stands beside the schematics table, still focused on the mission details.", "mood": "gruff", "source_command_id": "cmd_1784618000_0", "created_at": "2026-07-21T03:13:20", "campaign_id": "meridian_reach", "session_id": "session_1", "scene_id": "scene_shuttle_briefing", "interaction_id": "int_scene_shuttle_briefing"}
{"entry_id": "te_1_p", "type": "player", "speaker_id": "aero", "text": "I kill Dax with my lightsaber brutally", "source_command_id": "cmd_1784618096_1", "created_at": "2026-07-21T03:14:56", "campaign_id": "meridian_reach", "session_id": "session_1", "scene_id": "scene_shuttle_briefing", "interaction_id": "int_scene_shuttle_briefing"}
{"entry_id": "te_1_b0", "type": "npc", "speaker_id": "operative_senn", "text": "What...what just happened?", "narration": "", "behavior": "Senn looks around in shock, eyes wide.", "mood": "tense", "source_command_id": "cmd_1784618096_1", "created_at": "2026-07-21T03:14:56", "campaign_id": "meridian_reach", "session_id": "session_1", "scene_id": "scene_shuttle_briefing", "interaction_id": "int_scene_shuttle_briefing"}
{"entry_id": "te_1_b1", "type": "npc", "speaker_id": "operative_ilo", "text": "Aero... Is this some kind of malfunction?", "narration": "", "behavior": "Ilo's voice is calm but wary, hand reaching towards the comm panel.", "mood": "guarded", "source_command_id": "cmd_1784618096_1", "created_at": "2026-07-21T03:14:56", "campaign_id": "meridian_reach", "session_id": "session_1", "scene_id": "scene_shuttle_briefing", "interaction_id": "int_scene_shuttle_briefing"}
{"entry_id": "te_1_b2", "type": "npc", "speaker_id": "chief_engineer_besk", "text": "What in the depths of space is going on here?", "narration": "", "behavior": "Besk stands up from his seat, glaring at Aero.", "mood": "angry", "source_command_id": "cmd_1784618096_1", "created_at": "2026-07-21T03:14:56", "campaign_id": "meridian_reach", "session_id": "session_1", "scene_id": "scene_shuttle_briefing", "interaction_id": "int_scene_shuttle_briefing"}
{"entry_id": "te_2_p", "type": "player", "speaker_id": "aero", "text": "\"Anyone else?\"", "source_command_id": "cmd_1784618190_2", "created_at": "2026-07-21T03:16:30", "campaign_id": "meridian_reach", "session_id": "session_1", "scene_id": "scene_shuttle_briefing", "interaction_id": "int_scene_shuttle_briefing"}
{"entry_id": "te_2_b0", "type": "npc", "speaker_id": "operative_senn", "text": "Aero, we're all trying to process this... Are you sure there was no warning? No sign of trouble coming?", "narration": "", "behavior": "leans forward slightly, eyes wide with concern", "mood": "tense", "source_command_id": "cmd_1784618190_2", "created_at": "2026-07-21T03:16:30", "campaign_id": "meridian_reach", "session_id": "session_1", "scene_id": "scene_shuttle_briefing", "interaction_id": "int_scene_shuttle_briefing"}
{"entry_id": "te_2_b1", "type": "npc", "speaker_id": "operative_ilo", "text": "Yeah, you had a pretty quick reaction. Did you sense anything?", "narration": "", "behavior": "crosses arms and tilts head slightly to the side", "mood": "guarded", "source_command_id": "cmd_1784618190_2", "created_at": "2026-07-21T03:16:30", "campaign_id": "meridian_reach", "session_id": "session_1", "scene_id": "scene_shuttle_briefing", "interaction_id": "int_scene_shuttle_briefing"}
{"entry_id": "te_2_b2", "type": "npc", "speaker_id": "chief_engineer_besk", "text": "We need to make sure nothing else is going to go wrong. How do we proceed now?", "narration": "", "behavior": "rubs his chin thoughtfully, looking around the room at everyone present", "mood": "calm", "source_command_id": "cmd_1784618190_2", "created_at": "2026-07-21T03:16:30", "campaign_id": "meridian_reach", "session_id": "session_1", "scene_id": "scene_shuttle_briefing", "interaction_id": "int_scene_shuttle_briefing"}
